text = "HOW TO PLAY - KUSINA MAMA

MOVEMENT:
  W / A / S / D  —  Walk around the kitchen

INTERACT:
  E or Shift —  Enter a cooking station when prompted

IN MINIGAMES:
  W/A/S/D  or Arrow Keys —  Direction controls (heat, mixing)
Q or '/' —  Action Button 1
E or 'Shift' —  Action Button 2

GOAL:
Complete all recipe steps before time runs out!
Each step is scored on SKILL + SPEED.
  Earn stars and a grade: 1 / 2 / 3 STARS

RECIPES:
  • Kulawong Talong
• More recipes coming soon..."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

